4. Convert Videos Into IPTV Channels

Example FFmpeg command:

ffmpeg -re -i movie.mp4 \
-c:v libx264 \
-c:a aac \
-f hls stream.m3u8

This creates:

.ts video chunks
.m3u8 playlist
